      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_10",
      "hash64": "D97661BDBDC2750A",
      "text": "Well, yeah, I mean that’s true, but...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_11",
      "hash64": "D97662BDBDC276BD",
      "text": "Fine. I’ll let you off the hook this one time. You’d\\nbetter thank the boss for steppin’ in.[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_06",
      "hash64": "2C6DB9047B65C5AD",
      "text": "Don’t think poorly of Rika. She’s just worried\\nfor you.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_07",
      "hash64": "2C6DB8047B65C3FA",
      "text": "Now then, Champion [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_08",
      "hash64": "2C6DAB047B65ADE3",
      "text": "This time, you’ll be heading to Area Zero with\\nofficial League permission.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_09",
      "hash64": "2C6DAA047B65AC30",
      "text": "Only a handful of people know about the\\nincident involving the time machine.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_10",
      "hash64": "2C6A2D047B62A1F2",
      "text": "However, taking into account the dangers of\\nArea Zero, I have elected to inform Ms. Briar\\r\\nof what happened—obfuscating certain details.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_12",
      "hash64": "D9765FBDBDC271A4",
      "text": "Speaking of, Boss... Didn’t you say you had\\nsomething to give to that Briar person?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_11",
      "hash64": "2C6A2E047B62A3A5",
      "text": "...Yes. Yes, I did. I’d forgotten about that.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_12",
      "hash64": "2C6A2B047B629E8C",
      "text": "[VAR 0xBD06(0000)]Champion [VAR 0x0100(0000)],\\nwould\\r\\nyou\\r\\nbe\\r\\nso\\r\\nkind\\r\\nas\\r\\nto\\r\\ntake\\r\\nthis\\r\\nfor\\r\\nme?[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
