    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_15",
      "hash64": "2C6A2A047B629CD9",
      "text": "I honestly have no idea as to its true purpose...\\nBut I assume it has to do with Area Zero.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_16",
      "hash64": "2C6A27047B6297C0",
      "text": "I figured that since you’re heading to Area Zero,\\nI might as well ask you to investigate the purpose\\r\\nof this disk while you’re there.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 100,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 136,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_14",
      "hash64": "D9765DBDBDC26E3E",
      "text": "While [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0100)]she’s there, huh? Did you want h[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0202)]imer to pick\\nup some potato salad on the way back, too?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0100"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 43,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0202"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 103,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_17",
      "hash64": "2C6A28047B629973",
      "text": "I do ask that you return the disk to me if you end\\nup not finding a use for it.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_18",
      "hash64": "2C6A35047B62AF8A",
      "text": "There is still much we do not know about Area\\nZero...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_19",
      "hash64": "2C6A36047B62B13D",
      "text": "I know you’ve already been to its depths, but\\nplease exercise some caution while dealing with\\r\\nthe environment and Pokémon there.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 131,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_20",
      "hash64": "2C6727047B6061E9",
      "text": "As a Champion, it falls on you to protect and\\nguide those accompanying you.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 75,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_15",
      "hash64": "D9765EBDBDC26FF1",
      "text": "Wish I could go with you, kiddo, but I’ve got my\\nown work to do...[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_ground_16",
      "hash64": "D9765BBDBDC26AD8",
      "text": "Do your best down there, but don’t push yourself\\ntoo hard, y’hear?[VAR 0x0114(0013)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0013"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_chairman_21",
      "hash64": "2C6726047B606036",
      "text": "Now, please excuse us.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_brother_01",
      "hash64": "3C46D606237D94A9",
      "text": "Area Zero, right? C’mon, let’s go. I wanna get\\nstarted.[VAR 0x0114(0043)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0043"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "sdc02_0235_sister_01",
      "hash64": "E5ED13B7E0189975",
      "text": "Kiki’s awful quiet. I hope he’s OK... He was so\\nbent out of shape when he lost...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
